# Design Patterns

This project implements several utility tools for Development in C++.

# Contribution

Please let me know if you have any suggestions!

PRs, Comments and other methods are all welcome.

# Headers

```md
nitron/
├── functor.hpp
│   ├── Description: Functor templates concepts to strongly specify lambda expressions
│   └── Utilities:
│       └── concepts: StrictFunctor, LooseFunctor
├── pass.hpp
│   ├── Description: Development alerts for incomplete code
│   └── Utilities:
│       └── defines: NITRON_IN_PROGRESS, NITRON_REQUIRES_SPECIALIZATION
└── spec.hpp
    ├── Description: Test-Driven-Development support
    └── Utilities:
        └── classes: Test, Spec
```
